description:
 This check monitors the latency of AWS/ELB services.

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {{Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}}.

 No default levels are set.
 These are configurable.

discovery:
 One service is created if all required metrics (Latency) are given.
